      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[167].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[168].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[169].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[170].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Yes, what do you need?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I don't even know. Ask me what you're interested in.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].engFemaleNPCText
      value: You must be kidding! I worked on this ship, my friend.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Absolutely not. At first, I thought I should drop this vessel, but then
        the former colonel of the city security showed up. He assures us that one
        day this ship will sail again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].engFemaleNPCText
      value: You must be joking! Of course not! How can I restore it? Obviously,
        in our reality, and even in his powers, this is impossible.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Why should I leave him?! I was here before the crash! Let him get out
        of here! His propaganda is already in the ass!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].engFemaleNPCText
      value: It sounds very radical. I'm not sure if this is the right way out of
        the situation. I'm not capable of killing a human, even for good.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Don't even think about it! Yes, I can't stand him, but I can put up
        with what's going on and what's going to happen.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Do whatever you want!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I didn't make any arrangements with you!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].engFemaleNPCText
      value: You again!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].engFemaleNPCText
      value: You... Did you kill him?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].engFemaleNPCText
      value: You're a monster! I didn't ask you to, and now you're making me look
        like the instigator of this murder! I don't want to see you! Moreover, if
        I could kill, I would kill you right now!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Get out of my sight, you jerk.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Ya, apa yang kamu butuhkan?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Aku bahkan tidak tahu. Tanyakan apa yang Anda minati.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kamu pasti bercanda! Aku bekerja di kapal ini, bodoh.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Sama sekali tidak. Awalnya, saya pikir saya harus menjatuhkan kapal
        ini, tetapi kemudian mantan kolonel keamanan kota muncul. Dia meyakinkan
        kita bahwa suatu hari kapal ini akan berlayar lagi.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kamu pasti bercanda! Tentu saja tidak! Bagaimana saya bisa mengembalikannya?
        Jelas, dalam realitas kita, dan bahkan dalam kekuatannya, ini tidak mungkin.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Mengapa saya harus meninggalkannya?! Aku ada di sini sebelum kecelakaan!
        Biarkan dia pergi dari sini! Propagandanya sudah ada di pantat!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kedengarannya sangat radikal. Saya tidak yakin apakah ini jalan keluar
        yang benar dari situasi tersebut. Aku tidak mampu membunuh manusia, bahkan
        untuk selamanya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Jangan pernah memikirkannya! Ya, saya tidak tahan dengannya, tetapi
        saya bisa menerima apa yang sedang terjadi dan apa yang akan terjadi.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Lakukan apapun yang kamu mau!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Saya tidak membuat pengaturan apa pun dengan Anda!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kamu lagi!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kau... Apa kau membunuhnya?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kau monster! Aku tidak memintamu, dan sekarang kamu membuatku terlihat
        seperti penghasut pembunuhan ini! Aku tidak ingin melihatmu! Apalagi, jika
        aku bisa membunuh, aku akan membunuhmu sekarang juga!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Menyingkir dari pandanganku, brengsek.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Ya, apa yang kamu butuhkan?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Aku bahkan tidak tahu. Tanyakan apa yang Anda minati.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Kamu pasti bercanda! Aku bekerja di kapal ini, bodoh.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Sama sekali tidak. Awalnya, saya pikir saya harus menjatuhkan kapal
        ini, tetapi kemudian mantan kolonel keamanan kota muncul. Dia meyakinkan
        kita bahwa suatu hari kapal ini akan berlayar lagi.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Kamu pasti bercanda! Tentu saja tidak! Bagaimana saya bisa mengembalikannya?
        Jelas, dalam realitas kita, dan bahkan dalam kekuatannya, ini tidak mungkin.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
