    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].engMaleNPCText
      value: Maybe you've changed your mind?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[160].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[161].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[162].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[163].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[164].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[165].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[166].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[167].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[168].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[169].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].engMaleNPCText
      value: We need metal, namely certain parts to rebuild the ship. There is only
        one person who can help us with this issue - the Director. Director of a
        metal waste recycling plant. I marked it on your map.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[170].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u0447\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].engMaleNPCText
      value: This conman is a real bribe taker and a bandit! I covered for him for
        many years when I worked in the position. He won't be afraid of me anymore.
        I think you will be able to find an approach to it... Try to help him, and
        he will help us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].engMaleNPCText
      value: Did you manage to reach an agreement with the Director?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].engMaleNPCText
      value: I didn't doubt you, comrade. After all, it's really hard! The factory
        director wouldn't just cooperate with someone from the street.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].engMaleNPCText
      value: Our business is going as well as possible. The most difficult part is
        over, there is one small problem left.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[21].engMaleNPCText
      value: Our idea is being ruined by one woman. Yes, can you imagine?! It would
        seem that there is nothing terrible, but it destroys our faith in the future.
        She influences our team with her presence. He convinces everyone that the
        ship will never sail.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[22].engMaleNPCText
      value: What for? It's obvious! She wants to take over the government. Maybe
        she doesn't want to be the leader of the ship herself, but I'm sure someone
        is behind her. And this someone wants to take me out through a motorist.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[23].engMaleNPCText
      value: I thought you were already influenced by her. I'm sorry, but we're out
        of the way now. In the old days, I would have put you away, but now I work
        in a different way.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[24].engMaleNPCText
      value: 'I have high hopes for you. My advice to you: Don''t let her go, she
        can hurt you even without being on the ship.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[25].engMaleNPCText
      value: I hope you have good news?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[26].engMaleNPCText
      value: Did you get rid of her?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[27].engMaleNPCText
      value: It's true. I do not know how to thank you. I have nothing. But you should
        know that you are always welcome here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[28].engMaleNPCText
      value: Isn't it enough that you saved an entire community?! I do not know why
        you helped us then.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[29].engMaleNPCText
      value: We have a lot of recovery work to do. Let's talk another time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].engFemaleNPCText
      value: You're lucky to be here. Good afternoon.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].engFemaleNPCText
      value: We are just poor people dreaming of freedom.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Our freedom is symbolically enclosed in this broken vessel. When we
        restore it, the word "freedom" will no longer be just a word.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Yes, this is our path to utopia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I don't see anything stupid! All thoughts are material, even such a
        difficult task is humanly possible! And I am! I'm not alone! There's a whole
        group of us! We can handle it!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Everyone deserves utopia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I'm not a colonel anymore... I've renounced it. You can continue to
        mock us, but you can still help us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Are you here to make fun of us again?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Great! First, we need a guidebook. I need a compass!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].engFemaleNPCText
      value: If I were you, I would appeal to those who go out on the water. There's
        a boatman hanging around, I'd like to ask him.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Did you find the compass?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].engFemaleNPCText
      value: This small step is the beginning of a great deed, my friend.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].engFemaleNPCText
      value: The next step is no less important. You'll have to use all your charm
        skills...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Do you really want to end our journey there?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Well, that's your right.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Maybe you've changed your mind?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].engFemaleNPCText
      value: We need metal, namely certain parts to rebuild the ship. There is only
        one person who can help us with this issue - the Director. Director of a
        metal waste recycling plant. I marked it on your map.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].engFemaleNPCText
      value: This conman is a real bribe taker and a bandit! I covered for him for
        many years when I worked in the position. He won't be afraid of me anymore.
        I think you will be able to find an approach to it... Try to help him, and
        he will help us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Did you manage to reach an agreement with the Director?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I didn't doubt you, comrade. After all, it's really hard! The factory
        director wouldn't just cooperate with someone from the street.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Our business is going as well as possible. The most difficult part is
        over, there is one small problem left.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[21].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Our idea is being ruined by one woman. Yes, can you imagine?! It would
        seem that there is nothing terrible, but it destroys our faith in the future.
        She influences our team with her presence. He convinces everyone that the
        ship will never sail.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[22].engFemaleNPCText
      value: What for? It's obvious! She wants to take over the government. Maybe
        she doesn't want to be the leader of the ship herself, but I'm sure someone
        is behind her. And this someone wants to take me out through a motorist.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[23].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I thought you were already influenced by her. I'm sorry, but we're out
        of the way now. In the old days, I would have put you away, but now I work
        in a different way.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[24].engFemaleNPCText
      value: 'I have high hopes for you. My advice to you: Don''t let her go, she
        can hurt you even without being on the ship.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[25].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I hope you have good news?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[26].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Did you get rid of her?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[27].engFemaleNPCText
      value: It's true. I do not know how to thank you. I have nothing. But you should
        know that you are always welcome here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[28].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Isn't it enough that you saved an entire community?! I do not know why
        you helped us then.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[29].engFemaleNPCText
      value: We have a lot of recovery work to do. Let's talk another time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Anda beruntung berada di sini. Selamat siang.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kami hanya orang miskin yang memimpikan kebebasan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kebebasan kita secara simbolis tertutup dalam wadah yang rusak ini.
        Saat kita mengembalikannya, kata "kebebasan" tidak lagi hanya menjadi sebuah
        kata.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Ya, ini jalan kita menuju utopia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Saya tidak melihat sesuatu yang bodoh! Semua pikiran adalah material,
        bahkan tugas yang sulit seperti itu mungkin dilakukan secara manusiawi! Dan
        saya! Aku tidak sendirian! Ada seluruh kelompok dari kita! Kita bisa mengatasinya!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Setiap orang berhak atas utopia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Aku bukan kolonel lagi... Saya telah meninggalkannya. Anda dapat terus
        mengejek kami, tetapi Anda masih dapat membantu kami.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Apakah kamu di sini untuk mengolok-olok kita lagi?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Bagus! Pertama kita membutuhkan buku panduan. Aku butuh kompas!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Jika saya jadi Anda, saya akan memohon kepada mereka yang pergi ke air.
        Ada tukang perahu berkeliaran, saya ingin bertanya padanya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Apa kau menemukan kompasnya?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Langkah kecil ini adalah awal dari sebuah perbuatan besar, sobat.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Langkah selanjutnya tidak kalah pentingnya. Anda harus menggunakan semua
        keterampilan pesona Anda...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Apakah Anda benar-benar ingin mengakhiri perjalanan kita ke sana?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Nah, itu hak Anda.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Mungkin Anda sudah berubah pikiran?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kami membutuhkan logam, yaitu bagian-bagian tertentu untuk membangun
        kembali kapal. Hanya ada satu orang yang dapat membantu kami dalam masalah
        ini - Sutradara. Direktur pabrik daur ulang limbah logam. Aku menandainya
        di petamu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Penipu ini benar-benar penerima suap dan bandit! Saya menutupinya selama
        bertahun-tahun ketika saya bekerja di posisi itu. Dia tidak akan takut padaku
        lagi. Saya pikir Anda akan dapat menemukan pendekatan untuk itu... Cobalah
        untuk membantunya, dan dia akan membantu kita.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Apakah Anda berhasil mencapai kesepakatan dengan Sutradara?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Aku tidak meragukanmu, kawan. Bagaimanapun, ini sangat sulit! Direktur
        pabrik tidak akan hanya bekerja sama dengan seseorang dari jalanan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Bisnis kami berjalan dengan baik. Bagian tersulit sudah berakhir, ada
        satu masalah kecil yang tersisa.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[21].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Ide kami dirusak oleh seorang wanita. Ya, bisa Anda bayangkan?! Tampaknya
        tidak ada yang mengerikan, tetapi itu menghancurkan iman kita di masa depan.
        Dia memengaruhi tim kami dengan kehadirannya. Dia meyakinkan semua orang
        bahwa kapal itu tidak akan pernah berlayar.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[22].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Untuk apa? Sudah jelas! Dia ingin mengambil alih pemerintahan. Mungkin
        dia sendiri tidak ingin menjadi pemimpin kapal, tapi saya yakin ada seseorang
        di belakangnya. Dan seseorang ini ingin membawa saya keluar melalui pengendara
        mobil.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[23].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Saya pikir Anda sudah dipengaruhi olehnya. Maaf, tapi kita menyingkir
        sekarang. Di masa lalu, saya akan menjauhkan Anda, tetapi sekarang saya bekerja
        dengan cara yang berbeda.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[24].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: 'Saya memiliki harapan yang tinggi untuk Anda. Saran saya untuk Anda:
        Jangan biarkan dia pergi, dia bisa menyakiti Anda bahkan tanpa berada di
        kapal.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[25].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Saya harap Anda mendapat kabar baik?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[26].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Apa kau menyingkirkannya?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[27].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Itu benar. Saya tidak tahu bagaimana harus berterima kasih. Aku tidak
        punya apa-apa. Tetapi Anda harus tahu bahwa Anda selalu diterima di sini.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[28].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Bukankah cukup dengan menyelamatkan seluruh komunitas?! Saya tidak tahu
        mengapa Anda membantu kami saat itu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[29].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kami memiliki banyak pekerjaan pemulihan yang harus dilakukan. Mari
        kita bicara lain kali.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Anda beruntung berada di sini. Selamat siang.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Kami hanya orang miskin yang memimpikan kebebasan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Kebebasan kita secara simbolis tertutup dalam wadah yang rusak ini.
        Saat kita mengembalikannya, kata "kebebasan" tidak lagi hanya menjadi sebuah
        kata.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Ya, ini jalan kita menuju utopia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Saya tidak melihat sesuatu yang bodoh! Semua pikiran adalah material,
        bahkan tugas yang sulit seperti itu mungkin dilakukan secara manusiawi! Dan
        saya! Aku tidak sendirian! Ada seluruh kelompok dari kita! Kita bisa mengatasinya!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Setiap orang berhak atas utopia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Aku bukan kolonel lagi... Saya telah meninggalkannya. Anda dapat terus
        mengejek kami, tetapi Anda masih dapat membantu kami.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Apakah kamu di sini untuk mengolok-olok kita lagi?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Bagus! Pertama kita membutuhkan buku panduan. Aku butuh kompas!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Jika saya jadi Anda, saya akan memohon kepada mereka yang pergi ke air.
        Ada tukang perahu berkeliaran, saya ingin bertanya padanya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Apa kau menemukan kompasnya?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Langkah kecil ini adalah awal dari sebuah perbuatan besar, sobat.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Langkah selanjutnya tidak kalah pentingnya. Anda harus menggunakan semua
        keterampilan pesona Anda...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Apakah Anda benar-benar ingin mengakhiri perjalanan kita ke sana?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Nah, itu hak Anda.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Mungkin Anda sudah berubah pikiran?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Kami membutuhkan logam, yaitu bagian-bagian tertentu untuk membangun
        kembali kapal. Hanya ada satu orang yang dapat membantu kami dalam masalah
        ini - Sutradara. Direktur pabrik daur ulang limbah logam. Aku menandainya
        di petamu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
