    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Maybe I can help you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: How stupid it is to dream of restoring this metal.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].EngFemaleText
      value: Very cool! But that doesn't concern me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: There is a homeless man in your wonderful group who urinates under himself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: And you? You're a colonel, don't you think you deserve it?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I'll help you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: Well, good luck to you tramps.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I thought you could use my help.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: I was just passing by.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Where should I look for a compass?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I'll ask him.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Halo, apa yang kamu lakukan di sini?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Yes, here it is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: I haven't contacted the boatman yet.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Yes, yes, I get it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Who do I need to cooperate with?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: Wait, wait! I didn't say that I would help you further.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: No, I'm sorry. Go on.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: Yes, I think I've had enough of your idiotic company.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Yes, goodbye.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Yes, I overreacted, let's finish what we started.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: No!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Do you think he'll agree to stop production for our sake?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I will try.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Yes, he will provide the details.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: I'm in the process.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Yes, it's true.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Bukankah kamu sudah bebas sekarang?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Go on. What's the problem?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: You know what? Fuck this shit yourself, I'm fucked.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[21].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Why would she do that?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[22].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I won't let that happen.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[22].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: I think you're overreacting.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[23].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Disgusting.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[24].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I get you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[25].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: The news couldn't be better!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[25].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: I'm in the process.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[26].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Well, of course. Now you will reach utopia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[27].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Thank you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[27].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: Is that all?! Just a "thank you"?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[28].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: You're just a pig! I don't think it's necessary to let you live.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[28].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: No, you're right. I'm confused, I'm sorry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[29].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: No problem.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Apakah Anda ingin membangun kembali kapal?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Mungkin saya bisa membantu Anda?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Betapa bodohnya bermimpi memulihkan logam ini.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].IndonesianText
      value: Sangat keren! Tapi itu bukan urusanku.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Ada seorang tunawisma di kelompok Anda yang luar biasa yang buang air
        kecil di bawah dirinya sendiri.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Dan kamu? Anda seorang kolonel, tidakkah Anda pikir Anda pantas mendapatkannya?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Aku akan membantumu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Nah, semoga sukses untuk Anda gelandangan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Saya pikir Anda bisa menggunakan bantuan saya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Saya baru saja lewat.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Di mana saya harus mencari kompas?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Aku akan bertanya padanya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Ya, ini dia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Saya belum menghubungi tukang perahu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Ya, ya, aku mengerti.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Dengan siapa saya harus bekerja sama?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Saya tidak mengatakan bahwa saya akan membantu Anda lebih jauh.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Tidak, maafkan aku. Lanjutkan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Ya, saya pikir saya sudah muak dengan perusahaan bodoh Anda.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Ya, selamat tinggal.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Ya, saya bereaksi berlebihan, mari kita selesaikan apa yang kita mulai.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Tidak!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Apakah Anda pikir dia akan setuju untuk menghentikan produksi demi kita?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Saya akan mencoba.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Ya, dia akan memberikan detailnya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Saya sedang dalam proses.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Ya, itu benar.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Lanjutkan. Apa masalahnya?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Kau tahu apa? Persetan dengan omong kosong ini sendiri, aku kacau.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[21].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Mengapa dia melakukan itu?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[22].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Aku tidak akan membiarkan itu terjadi.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[22].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Saya pikir Anda bereaksi berlebihan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[23].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Menjijikkan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[24].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Aku mengerti.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[25].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Berita itu tidak bisa lebih baik!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[25].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Saya sedang dalam proses.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[26].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Yah, tentu saja. Sekarang Anda akan mencapai utopia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[27].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Terima kasih.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[27].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Itu saja?! Hanya "terima kasih"?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[28].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Kamu hanya seekor babi! Saya rasa tidak perlu membiarkan Anda hidup.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[28].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Tidak, kau benar. Saya bingung, maaf.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[29].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Tidak masalah.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Halo, apa yang kamu lakukan di sini?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Bukankah kamu sudah bebas sekarang?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Apakah Anda ingin membangun kembali kapal?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Mungkin saya bisa membantu Anda?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Betapa bodohnya bermimpi memulihkan logam ini.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Sangat keren! Tapi itu bukan urusanku.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Ada seorang tunawisma di kelompok Anda yang luar biasa yang buang air
        kecil di bawah dirinya sendiri.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Dan kamu? Anda seorang kolonel, tidakkah Anda pikir Anda pantas mendapatkannya?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Aku akan membantumu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Nah, semoga sukses untuk Anda gelandangan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Saya pikir Anda bisa menggunakan bantuan saya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Saya baru saja lewat.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Di mana saya harus mencari kompas?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Aku akan bertanya padanya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Ya, ini dia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Saya belum menghubungi tukang perahu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Ya, ya, aku mengerti.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Dengan siapa saya harus bekerja sama?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Saya tidak mengatakan bahwa saya akan membantu Anda lebih jauh.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Tidak, maafkan aku. Lanjutkan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Ya, saya pikir saya sudah muak dengan perusahaan bodoh Anda.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Ya, selamat tinggal.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Ya, saya bereaksi berlebihan, mari kita selesaikan apa yang kita mulai.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Tidak!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Apakah Anda pikir dia akan setuju untuk menghentikan produksi demi kita?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Saya akan mencoba.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Ya, dia akan memberikan detailnya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Saya sedang dalam proses.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Ya, itu benar.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Lanjutkan. Apa masalahnya?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Kau tahu apa? Persetan dengan omong kosong ini sendiri, aku kacau.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[21].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Mengapa dia melakukan itu?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[22].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Aku tidak akan membiarkan itu terjadi.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[22].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Saya pikir Anda bereaksi berlebihan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[23].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Menjijikkan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[24].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Aku mengerti.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[25].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Berita itu tidak bisa lebih baik!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[25].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Saya sedang dalam proses.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[26].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Yah, tentu saja. Sekarang Anda akan mencapai utopia.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[27].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Terima kasih.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[27].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Itu saja?! Hanya "terima kasih"?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[28].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Kamu hanya seekor babi! Saya rasa tidak perlu membiarkan Anda hidup.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[29].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Tidak masalah.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673753526489, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'm_Materials.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 484e3183d41b9e949800e14032f1a403, type: 2}
