    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Maybe... I have a propeller lying around, but it's useless without a
        battery. If you find me a battery, I'll drive you for free. But for you,
        pretty girl, I'll make an exception.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Of course, but how else?! I thought that was too much of a hint.
